  dialogueItems:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: If you don't like it, don't buy it
    <Influence>k__BackingField: 10
  - <Text>k__BackingField: This is a work of art
    <Influence>k__BackingField: 20
  - <Text>k__BackingField: This is worth more than it looks
    <Influence>k__BackingField: 5
  - <Text>k__BackingField: You can sell it for more later
    <Influence>k__BackingField: 5
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I swear to you it's worth it
    <Influence>k__BackingField: 15
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Come on, you know you like it
    <Influence>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Well, it's an item like any other
    <Influence>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Up to you, I'm not insisting
    <Influence>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Text>k__BackingField: The main thing is that you like it
    <Influence>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Traders seemed to praise it
    <Influence>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Nothing special
    <Influence>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Honestly, I'm not sure myself
    <Influence>k__BackingField: -5
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Looks a bit suspicious
    <Influence>k__BackingField: -5
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Honestly, I wouldn't take that
    <Influence>k__BackingField: -10
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Who even needs this?
    <Influence>k__BackingField: -20
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Well, for that price it'll do
    <Influence>k__BackingField: -10
